WEBVTT

00:00:45.546 --> 00:00:48.799
<i>Kokoro egakidasu</i>

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:52.386
<i>chizujou no michinaru frontier</i>

00:00:52.386 --> 00:00:55.806
<i>Tobira hiraitara</i>

00:00:55.806 --> 00:00:59.142
<i>michi wa tsuzuiteiru yo</i>

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:05.107
<i>Hokori makiagete kimi no machi e</i>

00:01:05.107 --> 00:01:11.822
<i>Sora to daichi ga kasanaru ruuto de</i>

00:01:11.822 --> 00:01:15.576
<i>Hashiru minamikaze ni notte</i>

00:01:15.576 --> 00:01:18.495
<i>Aoku somaru kaze wo kitte</i>

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:25.627
<i>Kokorogoto kakedashiteirun da</i>

00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:29.131
<i>Mahiru no tsuki wo oikoshite</i>

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:32.259
<i>Kinou to wa chigau sekai e</i>

00:01:32.259 --> 00:01:37.681
<i>Dokomademo hashirinuketeku</i>

00:01:37.681 --> 00:01:41.602
<i>Ano kaze no you ni</i>

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:46.899
<i>Ano kaze no you ni</i>

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:04.374
O God, who has wondrously created
the boundless expanse of blue sea,

00:02:04.374 --> 00:02:06.960
please protect these comrades
as they journey on the sea.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:12.216
O Lord, who formed even the surging waves
and raging winds according to Your great will,

00:02:12.216 --> 00:02:14.676
please protect these comrades
as they journey on the sea.

00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:17.304
O Spirit, who calms the chaotic,
bottomless depths

00:02:17.304 --> 00:02:19.890
and envelops us
in Your loving protection,

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:22.643
please protect these comrades
as they journey on the sea.

00:02:22.643 --> 00:02:27.898
O God, source of blessed power,
please protect them even in times of danger,

00:02:27.898 --> 00:02:30.943
and please guide them safely
to the harbor which they seek.

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:35.113
Now then, we will now be heading
directly to the zone of operation.

00:02:35.113 --> 00:02:36.615
Board ship!

00:02:36.907 --> 00:02:37.741
"Hong Kong in Two"

00:02:37.741 --> 00:02:42.162
These brain waves in the 30-50 Hz
range are called gamma waves.

00:02:42.162 --> 00:02:45.249
Apparently a Lambda Driver is capable
of generating a repulsive force field

00:02:45.249 --> 00:02:50.546
only when the strength of these waves
exceeds a certain set level.

00:02:50.546 --> 00:02:52.381
However, research
up to this point indicates

00:02:52.381 --> 00:02:56.510
that it is difficult for an individual to
generate powerful gamma waves intentionally,

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:58.679
not to mention continuously.

00:02:58.679 --> 00:03:01.598
There is a method for producing
a similar response artificially

00:03:01.598 --> 00:03:05.519
by administering a drug
called Type Ti970,

00:03:05.519 --> 00:03:08.230
which can only by synthesized at a limited
number of chemical plants. However...

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:09.857
In other words?

00:03:09.857 --> 00:03:15.320
It means using a Lambda Driver for a
long period of time is probably impossible.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:17.781
Excluding exceptions
like the Behemoth, of course.

00:03:17.781 --> 00:03:19.324
That may be so, but...

00:03:19.324 --> 00:03:22.452
if the enemy uses one,
there's nothing we can do about it.

00:03:22.452 --> 00:03:24.872
It's almost like, why even bother
with this conversation anyway?

00:03:24.872 --> 00:03:28.166
We do have the Arbalest, though.

00:03:28.166 --> 00:03:31.879
But if it fails to activate
again like in Nanking...

00:04:19.134 --> 00:04:20.010
Al.

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:23.555
Check. Identity confirmed
as Sergeant Sagara. Yes, Sergeant?

00:04:23.555 --> 00:04:24.806
How are you?

00:04:24.806 --> 00:04:28.852
The results of the check performed today
at 1730 hours were satisfactory.

00:04:28.852 --> 00:04:31.188
The individual responsible for performing
the check was First Lieutenant Sachs.

00:04:31.188 --> 00:04:37.277
The maintenance record number
is 051021-01B-F-001.

00:04:37.277 --> 00:04:39.821
Would you like to view this record?

00:04:42.491 --> 00:04:48.121
If you would like to perform a second check,
it is necessary to change the current settings.

00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:51.083
End training mode, connect to an
external power source, then...

00:04:51.083 --> 00:04:54.545
I only woke you up on a whim.

00:04:54.545 --> 00:04:55.754
Training message.

00:04:55.754 --> 00:04:59.258
Please explain the meaning
of the word "whim."

00:04:59.258 --> 00:05:01.134
Try deducing it on your own.

00:05:01.134 --> 00:05:02.845
Roger. Complete.

00:05:02.845 --> 00:05:05.055
Shall I show you the results
of my deductions?

00:05:05.055 --> 00:05:05.973
Go ahead.

00:05:05.973 --> 00:05:07.391
The meaning of "whim":

00:05:07.391 --> 00:05:11.562
Most likely match: A concept
similar to "discretion" or "doubt."

00:05:11.562 --> 00:05:15.649
Second possible match: A concept
similar to "enthusiasm" or "diligence."

00:05:15.649 --> 00:05:19.778
Third possible match: A concept
similar to "disorder" or "erratic."

00:05:19.778 --> 00:05:22.739
Fourth possible match:
A concept similar to "play."

00:05:22.739 --> 00:05:24.408
You know what "play" is?

00:05:24.408 --> 00:05:27.411
Affirmative. Is that
the concept of a "whim"?

00:05:27.411 --> 00:05:29.121
It's close to "play" and "erratic."

00:05:29.121 --> 00:05:32.082
Roger. Thank you for your cooperation.

00:05:32.082 --> 00:05:34.084
Who taught you what "play" is?

00:05:34.084 --> 00:05:37.212
Senior staff member
Bani Morauta, Sergeant.

00:05:37.212 --> 00:05:39.298
The engineer who made you?

00:05:39.298 --> 00:05:40.924
Affirmative.

00:05:40.924 --> 00:05:43.010
Your lousy father, huh?

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:44.428
Training message.

00:05:44.428 --> 00:05:47.014
What is the meaning of "lousy"?

00:05:47.014 --> 00:05:50.559
Stop saying "Training message"
every single time.

00:05:50.559 --> 00:05:53.478
It means a weapons system that doesn't
function properly at arbitrary times.

00:05:53.478 --> 00:05:55.105
In other words, you.

00:05:55.105 --> 00:05:55.856
Affirmative.

00:05:55.856 --> 00:05:59.067
The ARX system is incomplete.

00:05:59.067 --> 00:06:00.194
You admit it?

00:06:00.194 --> 00:06:01.361
Affirmative.

00:06:01.361 --> 00:06:03.947
And you are part of the cause.

00:06:03.947 --> 00:06:05.532
What did you say?

00:06:05.532 --> 00:06:09.786
The ARX system includes
you as a part of it.

00:06:09.786 --> 00:06:12.664
It is not complete
without your cooperation.

00:06:12.664 --> 00:06:14.708
Please tell me your problem.

00:06:14.708 --> 00:06:19.838
If you do, I may be able
to give you some sort of advice.

00:06:19.838 --> 00:06:22.007
Advice? From you?

00:06:22.007 --> 00:06:22.966
Affirmative.

00:06:22.966 --> 00:06:25.177
I don't have any problem.

00:06:25.177 --> 00:06:26.553
I do not think that is true.

00:06:26.553 --> 00:06:27.387
Why not?

00:06:27.387 --> 00:06:28.805
My intuition.

00:06:28.805 --> 00:06:30.140
Intuition?

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:33.560
Who taught you the word "intuition"?

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:37.856
Then tell your "intuition"
to stop making absurd accusations.

00:06:37.856 --> 00:06:40.400
Your order is nonsense.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:43.654
"Intuition" cannot be
controlled or persuaded.

00:06:43.654 --> 00:06:46.657
It comes from deep within the soul.

00:06:46.657 --> 00:06:49.159
You're the one who's saying nonsense.

00:06:49.159 --> 00:06:51.620
--Stop kidding around with me!
--Sousuke?

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:53.413
Sousuke, are you there?

00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:54.206
What is it?

00:06:54.206 --> 00:06:57.417
The lieutenant commander
is calling us. It's a mission.

00:06:57.417 --> 00:06:59.002
Mission...

00:07:00.879 --> 00:07:02.840
I believe you already know this,

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:06.718
but an AS of unknown affiliation
has appeared in Hong Kong.

00:07:06.718 --> 00:07:09.179
This unit, working alone,
has repeatedly caused destruction,

00:07:09.179 --> 00:07:13.517
and is believed to still be
in hiding somewhere in the city.

00:07:13.517 --> 00:07:16.061
The armies of both North and South
China have taken damage.

00:07:16.061 --> 00:07:18.689
From this coupled with the incident
in Nanking the other day,

00:07:18.689 --> 00:07:22.734
both countries are in a critically tense
situation, as you can see on this map.

00:07:22.734 --> 00:07:24.987
At this rate, the agreement between them
could be dissolved at any moment,

00:07:24.987 --> 00:07:28.198
turning the divided Hong Kong
into a battleground.

00:07:28.198 --> 00:07:31.577
It is impossible to tell what the political
outcome of this situation will be.

00:07:31.577 --> 00:07:34.246
First Lieutenant Clouseau
will take it from here.

00:07:34.246 --> 00:07:36.456
So there it is, huh?

00:07:36.456 --> 00:07:42.212
This was taken 26 hours ago,
near Yau Ma Tei on the Kowloon peninsula.

00:07:42.212 --> 00:07:45.757
We believe it is most likely the same
machine which we fought in Helmajistan.

00:07:45.757 --> 00:07:49.178
It destroyed one of the South
China Army's armored vehicles,

00:07:49.178 --> 00:07:52.222
then used a smoke bomb and disappeared.

00:07:52.222 --> 00:07:55.893
Since then, it's appeared then disappeared
in various places in Hong Kong and Kowloon,

00:07:55.893 --> 00:07:58.896
continuing to destroy anything in its path.

00:07:58.896 --> 00:08:04.109
Close to 10 AS units have been destroyed,
and there have been numerous casualties.

00:08:04.109 --> 00:08:06.904
Both the Northern and Southern
Armies are unable to destroy it,

00:08:06.904 --> 00:08:09.781
they can't tell where it is, and they can't
find any trends in its movements, either.

00:08:09.781 --> 00:08:11.491
Considering what we've seen in the past,

00:08:11.491 --> 00:08:14.661
this machine is probably equipped
with the ability to become invisible as well.

00:08:14.661 --> 00:08:16.663
What's that terrorist after?

00:08:16.663 --> 00:08:17.748
Unknown.

00:08:17.748 --> 00:08:19.499
No one has claimed responsibility.

00:08:19.499 --> 00:08:22.044
If I had to guess, I'd say the objective
is probably to reignite the Chinese civil war

00:08:22.044 --> 00:08:24.421
or to destroy Hong Kong's economy.

00:08:24.421 --> 00:08:26.048
Or,

00:08:26.048 --> 00:08:28.592
this could be a challenge meant for us.

00:08:28.592 --> 00:08:30.886
However, no matter what
kind of machine it is,

00:08:30.886 --> 00:08:33.972
it can't run at full capacity
for 24 hours alone.

00:08:33.972 --> 00:08:35.974
After a fight, the ammunition
needs to be replenished,

00:08:35.974 --> 00:08:37.100
simple maintenance
needs to be done,

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:40.771
and the operator must need
at least some rest.

00:08:40.771 --> 00:08:43.190
First, we need to figure out
where he's hiding,

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:45.859
then we will dispatch a single M9
platoon to surround him undetected,

00:08:45.859 --> 00:08:48.195
launch a surprise attack,
and finally subdue him.

00:08:48.195 --> 00:08:50.739
To do that, I'll need all of you
to run reconnaissance.

00:08:50.739 --> 00:08:51.865
Reconnaissance?

00:08:51.865 --> 00:08:54.785
This will be a joint mission between us and
the Intelligence Division's Hong Kong branch.

00:08:54.785 --> 00:08:56.537
They will provide
the necessary know-how,

00:08:56.537 --> 00:08:58.872
and you are to use it
to locate the enemy's hideout.

00:08:58.872 --> 00:09:01.625
We'll surface while it's still night,
and you'll leave by helicopter.

00:09:01.625 --> 00:09:04.002
Fly to Hong Kong one step
ahead of everyone else.

00:09:04.002 --> 00:09:05.212
Sousuke, too?

00:09:05.212 --> 00:09:06.088
Correct.

00:09:06.088 --> 00:09:08.966
How about having Sousuke
stand by with the Arbalest?

00:09:08.966 --> 00:09:12.970
The plan is to not use
the Arbalest for this mission.

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:13.804
Why?

00:09:13.804 --> 00:09:15.430
Because it's unreliable!

00:10:32.382 --> 00:10:37.012
"Hong Kong Special Ward: Mid-Level"

00:10:37.888 --> 00:10:41.850
When I look at it from up here,
it doesn't seem much different from before.

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:43.393
You've been here before?

00:10:43.393 --> 00:10:45.854
A few times, before it was
returned to the mainland.

00:10:45.854 --> 00:10:50.067
Relatives on my mother's side
used to live close to here.

00:10:50.067 --> 00:10:51.401
Before I came to Mithril,

00:10:51.401 --> 00:10:54.780
I freeloaded off of them for about
two months. Just loafing around.

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:56.657
Loafing around, huh?

00:10:56.657 --> 00:10:59.201
This was after I got
booted from the Marines.

00:10:59.201 --> 00:11:01.036
I didn't feel like working,

00:11:01.036 --> 00:11:03.956
and I didn't want to go back
to my parents in New York either.

00:11:03.956 --> 00:11:05.832
My dad was always pestering me.

00:11:05.832 --> 00:11:08.168
Damn Air Force bastard...

00:11:08.168 --> 00:11:10.045
Your father was a military man?

00:11:10.045 --> 00:11:11.129
That's right.

00:11:11.129 --> 00:11:13.715
A dingbat bomber pilot.

00:11:13.715 --> 00:11:16.218
He's retired and running
a company now, though.

00:11:16.218 --> 00:11:19.304
He's always been a tightwad
and a coward, but he acts all cocky,

00:11:19.304 --> 00:11:21.306
and on top of that,
he's always plotting something.

00:11:21.306 --> 00:11:23.100
--Plotting?
--Yeah.

00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:25.894
When I graduated high school
and was looking for a real job,

00:11:25.894 --> 00:11:31.024
he pulled a bunch of strings to try
to get me married to some rich Harvard guy.

00:11:31.024 --> 00:11:33.193
It pissed me off, of course.

00:11:33.193 --> 00:11:34.486
So to get back at him,

00:11:34.486 --> 00:11:37.739
right on the day of the wedding,
I went and joined the Marines!

00:11:37.739 --> 00:11:39.116
Oh, man...

00:11:39.116 --> 00:11:43.203
I snuck out of the chapel alone and went
to a recruiting office four blocks away,

00:11:43.203 --> 00:11:45.789
still in my wedding dress.

00:11:45.789 --> 00:11:50.210
The corporal on duty got this wide-eyed look
on his face, and asked me, "Are you serious?"

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:52.004
I said "Of course!"

00:11:52.004 --> 00:11:55.174
Everyone there tried
to convince me not to do it.

00:11:55.174 --> 00:11:58.093
They said, "Listen, Miss Bride,
I think you should reconsider."

00:11:58.093 --> 00:12:00.220
"I'm sure your parents would be sad."

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:03.974
Then I told them,
"My dad is in the Air Force."

00:12:03.974 --> 00:12:06.143
When they heard that,
they all said at once,

00:12:06.143 --> 00:12:09.354
"Then that makes things simple.
Please sign these documents."

00:12:11.148 --> 00:12:13.233
What do you think
about a woman like that?

00:12:13.233 --> 00:12:16.820
It's the best!
So cool! Right, Woo?

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:18.363
Yeah, seriously! The best!

00:12:20.157 --> 00:12:22.367
The best, huh?

00:12:22.367 --> 00:12:26.163
Yeah, that time really was the best...

00:12:26.163 --> 00:12:27.748
The moment I made my decision,

00:12:27.748 --> 00:12:30.375
it felt like the whole world opened up,
without any boundaries.

00:12:30.375 --> 00:12:35.214
It felt like I could do anything,
and go anywhere.

00:12:35.214 --> 00:12:36.798
Anywhere?

00:12:38.091 --> 00:12:41.094
Of course, a lot has
happened since then.

00:12:41.094 --> 00:12:44.181
I've experienced horrible
frustration and disappointment.

00:12:44.181 --> 00:12:47.309
But I think I really did
the right thing then.

00:12:47.309 --> 00:12:51.438
I've gotten to like myself
a lot more than before.

00:12:51.438 --> 00:12:53.607
Well, that's my story.

00:12:54.858 --> 00:12:57.778
Anyway, coming to this city
triggered some memories, that's all.

00:12:57.778 --> 00:12:59.863
Don't think about it too much.

00:13:01.406 --> 00:13:03.909
Phew, sorry to keep you waiting.

00:13:03.909 --> 00:13:07.037
I'm Hunter, from the Hong Kong
branch of the Intelligence Division.

00:13:09.248 --> 00:13:11.250
This goes without saying,

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:15.295
but both the Northern and Southern
armies have become downright nervous.

00:13:15.295 --> 00:13:20.133
We must act secretly, and avoid provoking
either party as much as possible.

00:13:20.133 --> 00:13:22.094
Because of the strict security,
both armies have almost completely

00:13:22.094 --> 00:13:24.096
suspended any movement
in either North or South.

00:13:24.096 --> 00:13:27.933
The harbor is closed,
and most flights are cancelled.

00:13:27.933 --> 00:13:31.603
Because of that, stock prices
and the exchange rate have plummeted.

00:13:31.603 --> 00:13:34.398
There don't seem to be
many ways out of this situation.

00:13:34.398 --> 00:13:36.483
So, what about the AS causing this mess?

00:13:36.483 --> 00:13:40.112
We still can't get a fix
on its location at all.

00:13:40.112 --> 00:13:45.117
It last appeared at 1015 hours,
in Shau Kei Wan in Hong Hong.

00:13:45.117 --> 00:13:48.370
You're positive it's hiding somewhere
in the Hong Kong area, right?

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:53.959
I can't confirm it, but our
analysts and AI think so.

00:13:53.959 --> 00:13:56.378
And so does my intuition
gained by long years of experience!

00:13:56.378 --> 00:13:59.506
We went ahead and pinpointed
possible locations.

00:14:00.549 --> 00:14:02.259
How about it?

00:14:05.262 --> 00:14:08.182
Excluding the suburbs
and small islands,

00:14:08.182 --> 00:14:11.268
we'll search all other areas
from the sky with our helicopters.

00:14:11.268 --> 00:14:14.771
I don't think anti-ECS sensors
will be usable within an urban area,

00:14:14.771 --> 00:14:17.232
so we'll have to go street by street.

00:14:17.232 --> 00:14:20.277
Also, there's no need to search
areas with a lot of doves or crows.

00:14:20.277 --> 00:14:21.945
Why birds?

00:14:21.945 --> 00:14:25.073
It seems birds can see AS units.

00:14:25.073 --> 00:14:29.411
Probably because the ECS can't hide
an AS in the UV spectrum.

00:14:29.411 --> 00:14:32.080
Crows are particularly noisy.

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:34.041
And dogs, too.

00:14:34.041 --> 00:14:36.293
They're sensitive to the smell
of the ozone from the ECS.

00:14:36.293 --> 00:14:38.086
I see.

00:14:38.086 --> 00:14:39.254
Anything else?

00:14:41.381 --> 00:14:43.091
I think that's all.

00:14:45.135 --> 00:14:46.512
Sousuke?

00:14:48.138 --> 00:14:49.264
You have anything else to add?

00:14:49.264 --> 00:14:52.267
No, not really.

00:14:54.019 --> 00:14:57.022
Hmm, this seems like it might work out.

00:14:57.022 --> 00:15:02.277
Forty-nine locations in Hong Kong,
and 78 locations in Kowloon.

00:15:02.277 --> 00:15:05.489
If we divide the search between us
and them, it could get done in one day.

00:15:05.489 --> 00:15:07.991
If conditions are favorable, that is.

00:15:11.203 --> 00:15:12.538
Man...

00:15:12.538 --> 00:15:16.542
"Hunter Cleaning Co., Ltd."
That old guy seems to do a really wide variety of business.

00:15:18.335 --> 00:15:20.546
All right, it's time to get moving.

00:15:20.546 --> 00:15:23.048
This place is under
martial law, so be careful.

00:15:23.048 --> 00:15:24.258
What if the army or police

00:15:24.258 --> 00:15:26.301
look like they're going to detain us
at one of their checkpoints?

00:15:26.301 --> 00:15:29.388
There must be a lot of troops where
Hunter doesn't have any influence, right?

00:15:29.388 --> 00:15:30.389
That's true.

00:15:30.389 --> 00:15:33.809
If you can run away, then run away.
But you're not allowed to open fire.

00:15:33.809 --> 00:15:36.562
The army guys haven't
done anything wrong.

00:15:36.562 --> 00:15:37.604
If you get caught,

00:15:37.604 --> 00:15:40.691
you'll probably face a tough interrogation
until Hunter pulls some strings,

00:15:40.691 --> 00:15:44.111
but keep your mouth shut,
even if you're tortured. That is all.

00:15:44.111 --> 00:15:45.362
Man, that's harsh...

00:15:45.362 --> 00:15:49.366
More importantly, you'd better think about
what actions to take if you sight the enemy.

00:15:49.366 --> 00:15:51.368
I will not tolerate you getting
killed without contacting me

00:15:51.368 --> 00:15:52.995
or getting my permission.

00:15:52.995 --> 00:15:54.955
--Understood?
--Roger.

00:16:24.067 --> 00:16:25.903
What a shock...

00:16:25.903 --> 00:16:28.071
I've never seen Central like this before.

00:16:49.426 --> 00:16:52.471
Now, I wonder if they'll let us
pass through without a fuss.

00:16:52.471 --> 00:16:54.264
If Hunter's contacts are good...

00:16:55.307 --> 00:16:56.475
"Stop!"

00:16:56.475 --> 00:16:57.726
Mao, it's up to you.

00:17:00.354 --> 00:17:02.439
"Understood. Open the window."

00:17:05.359 --> 00:17:08.570
"We're from Hunter Cleaning Co., Ltd.
I believe you've been informed about us."

00:17:12.115 --> 00:17:14.701
"What are you carrying in the back?"

00:17:14.701 --> 00:17:18.664
"As you can see, cleaning tools.
Is there a problem?"

00:17:18.664 --> 00:17:19.957
"No... Okay."

00:17:21.124 --> 00:17:22.501
"He said we can pass!"

00:17:33.428 --> 00:17:38.100
Unbelievable. This tunnel
was always jammed with traffic.

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:39.434
I see.

00:17:39.434 --> 00:17:42.479
Anyone who knew what Hong Kong
was like before would be shocked.

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:49.069
Just try to imagine.
What if Tokyo ended up like this?

00:17:49.069 --> 00:17:51.405
It's like if Shinjuku and Ginza
were divided into two,

00:17:51.405 --> 00:17:54.741
and right on the brink
of war with each other.

00:17:54.741 --> 00:17:58.871
The streets where fashionable kids
used to shop and eat ice cream

00:17:58.871 --> 00:18:01.582
are now filled with armored
vehicles and AS units.

00:18:01.582 --> 00:18:03.542
The bayside, which used to be
perfect for a nice walk,

00:18:03.542 --> 00:18:06.545
is dominated by gigantic
pillboxes and bunkers.

00:18:06.545 --> 00:18:09.464
This Hong Kong... It's abnormal!

00:18:09.464 --> 00:18:11.550
It's insane.

00:18:13.969 --> 00:18:15.345
Sousuke?

00:18:15.345 --> 00:18:16.513
Is something wrong?

00:18:16.513 --> 00:18:18.432
It's nothing.

00:18:35.199 --> 00:18:36.533
This is a surprise.

00:18:36.533 --> 00:18:38.827
The Southern Army's
letting us pass easily, too.

00:18:41.538 --> 00:18:44.374
Looks like Hunter's
some sort of big shot.

00:19:18.617 --> 00:19:20.661
We're almost there.

00:19:20.661 --> 00:19:23.247
What should we do if we hit
the jackpot right off the bat?

00:19:23.247 --> 00:19:25.874
We won't do anything.
There's always...

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:33.382
Sagara, calm down!

00:19:33.382 --> 00:19:36.218
You're confused and having delusions!

00:19:36.218 --> 00:19:37.344
--Sagara!
--Sousuke!

00:19:44.852 --> 00:19:45.853
"Hey! Stop screwing around!"

00:19:45.853 --> 00:19:47.855
"Where in the hell were you looking?!
Get out of here!"

00:19:49.398 --> 00:19:52.401
Let me handle this.
You keep your mouth shut!

00:19:52.401 --> 00:19:54.528
--I...
--That's enough! Just don't do anything!

00:19:56.613 --> 00:19:59.366
"I'm sorry, it was the driver's..."

00:19:59.366 --> 00:19:59.950
"Quiet!"

00:20:01.285 --> 00:20:02.703
"Get out of the car, now!"

00:20:07.749 --> 00:20:09.585
"Wait, listen! You've got it all wrong!"

00:20:09.585 --> 00:20:11.378
"The driver had something in his eye!"

00:20:11.378 --> 00:20:12.588
"He couldn't help that, right?"

00:20:40.782 --> 00:20:41.825
Sousuke!

00:21:07.059 --> 00:21:08.977
"Confirm the damage!
Get me a report, fast!"

00:21:08.977 --> 00:21:10.020
"There's one over here, too!"

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:11.063
"Someone bring a stretcher!"

00:21:11.063 --> 00:21:13.065
"This area is now blocked off!
Contact headquarters immediately!"

00:21:15.567 --> 00:21:19.696
This isn't the time for them to have to
deal with us, so they're letting us slide.

00:21:19.696 --> 00:21:21.740
Let's go.

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:23.575
Running a red light...

00:21:23.575 --> 00:21:24.618
You're beyond redemption.

00:21:26.036 --> 00:21:27.663
Sorry.

00:21:27.663 --> 00:21:29.873
Were you thinking
about her or something?

00:21:31.625 --> 00:21:33.460
Forget about her now!

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:36.630
If you can't do that,
get out of the car right now!

00:21:37.840 --> 00:21:39.550
I understand your situation.

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:43.303
But I'm not <i>that </i>nice of a "big sister."

00:21:43.303 --> 00:21:45.597
I don't wanna die a victim of your problems.

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:50.811
With the state you're in,
I'd be a lot safer by myself!

00:21:52.354 --> 00:21:54.565
You're right.

00:21:54.565 --> 00:21:56.233
Sousuke?

00:21:56.233 --> 00:21:57.860
Sorry.

00:21:57.860 --> 00:22:00.571
I can't do this anymore.

00:22:00.571 --> 00:22:01.947
Continue the mission.

00:22:27.764 --> 00:22:33.312
<i>Kitto kimi wa kyou no hi mo</i>

00:22:33.312 --> 00:22:39.193
<i>Massugu ashita wo miteru</i>

00:22:39.193 --> 00:22:44.907
<i>Kaze ga fuku ano oka ni saita</i>

00:22:44.907 --> 00:22:51.663
<i>himawari no you ni</i>

00:22:53.582 --> 00:22:59.505
<i>Donna ni tooku hanareteite mo</i>

00:22:59.505 --> 00:23:05.511
<i>Kono utagoe ga kimi ni todoku you ni</i>

00:23:05.511 --> 00:23:11.558
<i>Namida ga zutto tomaranai yoru</i>

00:23:11.558 --> 00:23:17.898
<i>Kimi no mado wo terasu tsuki ni naritai</i>

00:23:17.898 --> 00:23:25.948
<i>Mata kanarazu aeru to</i>

00:23:28.283 --> 00:23:31.870
<i>Sou omou kara</i>

00:23:45.259 --> 00:23:45.717
"Next Episode"

00:23:45.717 --> 00:23:47.177
<i>Abandoning the mission.</i>

00:23:47.177 --> 00:23:51.890
<i>Having lost sight of everything,</i>
<i>I was wandering the streets of Hong Kong.</i>

00:23:51.890 --> 00:23:53.475
<i>I don't have any place to go,</i>

00:23:53.475 --> 00:23:56.436
<i>or even the skill</i>
<i>to take refuge in depravity.</i>

00:23:56.436 --> 00:23:58.772
<i>Next time: "His Problem."</i>

00:23:58.772 --> 00:24:00.732
<i>Despite my hardened heart,</i>

00:24:00.732 --> 00:24:04.715
<i>the situation is getting</i>
<i>even more tense.</i>
